Today, we pause to express our deepest gratitude to all Purple Heart recipients and their families. Their courage and sacrifice will never be forgotten.

National Purple Heart Day commemorates the creation of the oldest military decoration in the U.S. military - the Purple Heart.

It serves as a solemn reminder of the profound personal sacrifices made by members of the U.S. Armed Forces in defense of our Nation. ♠️💜
